{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","section":{"2":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":986,"arabicnumber":986,"text":"حدثنا عبد الله بن سعيد الكندي، حدثنا يونس، - يعني ابن بكير - عن محمد بن اسحاق، عن عبد الرحمن بن الاسود، عن ابيه، عن عبد الله، قال من السنة ان يخفى التشهد","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":597}}]}